WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:02.350
Chara-su!

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.440
Is everyone shugo-shugo-peppy today?

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.150
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.850
Let's enjoy it together!

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:12.640
Everyone's Hearts: Unlock!

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:29.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:32.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:44.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:50.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:54.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:57.720
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:01.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:04.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:07.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:11.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:15.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:18.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:21.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:25.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:29.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:32.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:36.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:48.850
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:51.460
"Grilling Mochi."

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:03.860
I'm hungry...

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:06.570
Won't the mochi grill any faster?

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:09.450
You can do it, mochi! Fight!

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.300
Yay!

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:24.500
My mochi!

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.600
That's hot!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.710
I hope the mochi grills quickly.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:43.890
I wonder what it'd be like if I drew
a face on the mochi with nori?

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:46.610
Pretty cute!

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.050
A sad face!

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.430
A face that's going "eek!"

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:54.600
An angry face!

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:58.900
They're all so cute, it'd
be a shame to eat it.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:05.320
That's hot!

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:11.400
Kiseki and Temari seem to be spending
a lot of time together lately.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.360
That's jealousy!

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:19.090
Note: "Yakimochi" can mean grilled mochi or jealousy

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:18.210
And Rhythm and Kusukusu have been spending
a lot of time together recently.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.880
That's also jealousy!

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:25.380
I wonder if the mochi will grill quickly?

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.390
Thanks for saving me.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.040
You saved me.

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:54.940
Miki, come on out.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:57.630
I made enough mochi for you, too.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.750
Thank goodness!

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:04.440
I didn't grill any mochi so
I was hoping you'd ask.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.620
Let's all eat together.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.680
Let's eat!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.310
It's hot!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.890
See you again!

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:14.610
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:17.410
The first Character we'll
introduce today is...

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:19.630
Nana!

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.160
Nana, who loves banana youkan!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:31.040
She looks like a cute French doll, but when she opens
her mouth, she's got a full-on Nagoya accent!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.370
That discontinuity is what
makes her fun.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:40.650
She's the Guardian Character of Lulu, the girl who extracted
hearts' eggs from kids and turned them into ? Eggs.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.210
The second Character
we'll introduce is...

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.350
Cecil!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:57.780
Cecil is the Guardian Character of the charismatic
elementary school idol, Yua!

00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:02.320
Her orange hat and muffler are very
stylish and cute, don't you think?

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:08.120
She loves singing, but she
isn't very good at it...

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:17.780
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara
Encyclopedia's each week!

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.310
Look forward to it!

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.720
Shugo Chara Nail Art!

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:29.970
Let's design nail art using images
from Shugo Chara!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.020
Today it's Amulet Heart!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:36.030
We'll be making ones that're cheerful
and happy like Ran!

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.710
When you think of Ran,
you need a big heart!

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:44.180
Use a heart sticker!

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:49.810
I hope I can paint this right...

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:52.820
A diagonal white line, right?

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:55.940
You can do it!

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:02.330
Use a red sneaker sticker like Ran's!

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:05.310
Yeah! It's nice and peppy!

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.340
A lucky seven right in the center!

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.610
That's cool!

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:16.800
All done!

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:19.360
Finished!

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:21.540
Nail art with Ran as the inspiration!

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.250
They're really cute!

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.580
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:34.850
"Advice Squad - Part 2."

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.770
Something isn't right.

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:47.410
This is troubling.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.530
What are you doing-dechu?

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:51.880
Temari's in a slump, see.

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:56.600
I want to come up with a new dance,
but it is quite difficult.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:57.870
I see.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.840
The suffering artist.

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:02.840
How about you just do
a complete makeover!

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.120
That'd be totally cool!

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.570
Well, that's easier said than done...

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:11.560
Ms. Dia!

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:14.100
You're lost, aren't you, Temari-chan?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:14.990
Yes...

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:18.080
Just leave this to us!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:18.950
Ran and...

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:19.750
...Dia's...

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.460
...Advice Squad!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:26.110
Small white snowflakes dance
down from the sky,

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:33.100
pile up in winter upon the land, and when spring
knocks, become a river, flowing to the sea...

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:36.190
Anything can change its form!

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:38.350
Don't be afraid, and plow
straight ahead!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.380
Oh, that's good.

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:41.630
But...

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:49.380
A bird is not a bird at first. A bird must first
learn how to fly to become a bird.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.610
Nobody can do it right at first!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:56.700
It might seem scary, but if you try it you
might do better than you think!

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.340
There's some truth to that-dechu.

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:03.080
But, my dancing up until
now has been...

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:06.740
The floating clouds know
not their own form...

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:09.430
They ride the wind, their
form ever changing...

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:13.280
Their today different from
their yesterday, and yet...

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.750
A cloud is ever, a cloud.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:17.560
Don't box yourself in!

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:20.100
You might meet a new you!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.180
You betcha!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:25.480
And so now, Dia and I
will give you a cheer!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.140
Yay, yay, Temari!

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:28.800
You can do it, you can do it, Temari!

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.480
Yay!

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:33.740
A new me?

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.210
I'll try changing my image!

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:41.710
It's rock and roll, baby!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.460
Cool!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.980
Good for you, Temari!

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:46.670
Congratulations!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.280
That's it for Ran...

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:49.040
...and Dia's...

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.670
...Advice Squad!

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.590
Chin, Ton, Shan, baby!

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:54.880
See you again!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.850
Shugo Chara Nail Art!

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:02.600
Let's design nail art using images
from Shugo Chara!

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:04.990
Next it's Amulet Clover!

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:09.840
We'll be making ones that're
fluffy and sweet like Su!

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:13.820
Let's make a French nail!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.900
You're good at this!

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:22.080
You gotta have a clover mark, right?

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:27.930
This is hard!

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:28.980
You can do it!

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:31.620
That white ribbon is cute!

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:43.790
That's just like Su!

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.650
A lovely little bear!

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:46.440
Yeah.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.400
All done!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.180
Finished!

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:53.120
Nail art with Su as the inspiration!

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.710
Lovely, don't you think?

00:09:57.590 --> 00:10:01.280
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:05.370
Today's episode is "Go Rikka! Follow
the Way of the Guardians!"

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:09.890
Rikka-chan finally gave
birth to her egg?

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:11.900
Could be!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:26.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:30.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:40.820
Since I met you I've been
in a tizzy every day.

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:46.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:51.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:56.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:56.500 --> 00:11:04.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:10.290
I have something to say.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:16.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:22.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:27.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:34.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:45.510
All right!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:48.020
My egg was born!

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:49.870
Yippee! Yippee!

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.160
My egg!

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:52.750
Yippee! Yahoo!

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.360
My Guardian Egg!

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:01.240
It's not coming out...

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.450
Hey, come on out!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:06.950
We've got you completely surrounded!

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:11.240
Stop this pointless resistance and
come out with your hands up!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.430
Hurry up and hatch!

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:16.710
Hatch!

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.570
Not hatching...

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:32.250
Maybe it takes some time?

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.210
Oh, well...

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:39.140
16 - Go Rikka! Follow
the Way of the Guardians!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:42.070
Tada! It was born!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:44.070
And your point?

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.810
Hey, Hikaru!

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:49.590
Geez!

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:51.250
Good morning, Rikka!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.750
Amu-senpai!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.540
Your egg!

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:57.770
It was born!

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:58.540
Yes!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.740
See, we knew it'd be born.

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:01.490
Yup.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:03.400
That feeling we had back then...

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.950
...was completely on the mark.

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:07.590
So, when was it born?

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.910
It was there when I woke up.

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:11.810
I was totally shocked!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.100
That's how it was for me, too.

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.590
Good for you, Rikka.

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:22.560
Yeah!

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.860
Pepe-chan, you know what
this means, right?

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:29.700
It's only a matter of time until Rikka-tan's
a member of the Guardians.

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:30.690
In other words...

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:34.150
She'll be my subordinate for real!

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:38.610
All we have to do is wait for her Guardian
Character to hatch-dechu!

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:39.590
Yeah!

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:42.050
Hurry and hatch! Hatch away!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:45.410
Hey, give me back my egg!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.630
Maybe we should try warming
it up-dechu?

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.580
I wonder what kind of Guardian
Character will hatch?

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:53.140
If we imagine based off Rikka-chan's
personality...

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.300
Lively...

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.210
And talkative...

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:57.930
A fussy old lady like this?

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:59.180
No way!

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:00.410
Good morning!

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:04.110
Nagihiko-senpai, yay!

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.100
Your egg was born!

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:07.510
Congratulations!

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:10.020
I want to tell Kiseki and
the others right away!

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.190
Yeah.

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:15.160
It's Hinamori-san and Nagihiko-san
together!

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:19.550
Hinamori-senpai is so awesome...

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:21.380
Hey, I'm here too!

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.560
Don't ignore me!

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.590
They're really shining.

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:29.570
I wish I could become
a Guardian already.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.800
Hatch nice and soon, 'kay?

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:41.020
Rikka-chan's really working hard.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:44.910
Yeah. Maybe she's motivated
now that her egg was born.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:47.620
Rikka-chan is really radiant.

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:56.810
Is having your egg born really something
to be that happy about?

00:14:57.380 --> 00:15:00.250
Yaya-senpai, I have brought
the watering can.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.200
Excellent! Commence watering!

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.660
Roger!

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:13.850
The flowers are doing well today, and Rikka
is getting more serious every day.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:18.940
Yaya's really gotten into the
mentor role, hasn't she?

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:21.340
Even Yaya-tan's got to grow
up sometime-dechu.

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:23.500
But you'll always stay a baby, Pepe.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.730
That's just who I am-dechu!

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:27.820
Next we'll clear rubbish.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:28.920
Okay!

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:29.540
Go!

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:31.210
Let's go, Hikaru!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.050
This is a waste of effort.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:40.930
Don't they have a vacuum cleaner?

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:45.610
Look at them, they're clearing rubbish!

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.600
How lame!

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:50.650
What did you just say?

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.980
They're those apprentice
Guardians, aren't they?

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:56.350
Guardian garbagemen, more like!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.050
Let's go!

00:15:59.050 --> 00:15:59.980
Yeah!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:09.620
The Guardians are garbagemen?

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:21.850
Rikka-tan, you're finished already?

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:28.700
Yaya-senpai, is this part
of the Guardian's job?

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.720
You mean picking up rubbish?

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:34.840
Yeah...

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:41.390
The Guardians are a sort of special student council
that works for the student's benefit.

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:44.070
Amu-senpai...

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:45.390
That's right!

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:49.720
It puts you in a good mood when the
school's sparkling clean, you know?

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:56.980
I'll clean up.

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.510
Rikka-tan...

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:02.080
What's the matter?

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:04.460
Something seems different-dechu...

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.410
I wonder what happened?

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:10.060
Amu-chan, Rikka-chan's
radiance has dimmed.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:20.040
The Guardians were supposed to be a shining
beacon that all the students looked up to...

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.080
What's the matter?

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:28.340
Come here!

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:39.110
Where did Rikka-tan go off to?

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:40.620
Wait up!

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:41.910
It's an X Egg!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.000
Hey, what's the matter?

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.290
Calm down!

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:53.340
Colorful Canvas!

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:56.700
Amu-senpai!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:00.140
How many times do I have to tell you,
going after X Eggs alone is dangerous!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.160
I'm sorry...

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:05.940
But it wouldn't listen to
what I said at all...

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:08.160
Just leave this to Yaya!

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:12.890
Children who won't listen
should just go to bed!

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:14.740
Merry Merry!

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.250
F-Finally!

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:22.340
This is the first time...

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:24.200
...Merry Merry worked properly-dechu!

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.210
We did it!

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.840
We did it! We did it!

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.090
It's a success!

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:31.770
Yaya-chan would always end
up asleep too before.

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:34.000
Yaya-chan has improved!

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:43.450
Oh, that X Egg is in the acting club.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:44.700
Acting club?

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:45.620
Right.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:46.990
So that means that before was...

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:49.140
...just acting.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.550
What? No fair!

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:58.080
"I'm always stuck in supporting roles
and can never shine as a lead."

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:00.330
"So I just want to quit that
stupid acting club."

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:03.230
I think I can understand its feelings.

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:09.650
I also want to be the shining star of
the school as a Guardian, but...

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:12.160
There's no difference between a
leading role or a supporting one!

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:17.380
You can sparkle in either one,
just the same!

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:21.580
Everyone can sparkle in them?

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:26.520
The Guardians are a sort of special student council
that works for the student's benefit.

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:30.390
A student council that works
for the student's benefit...

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:34.570
It puts you in a good mood when the
school's sparkling clean, you know?

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:39.160
When the Guardians sparkle,
so does everyone else.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.910
I see! If the Guardians are the leading roles,
then the students are also leading roles!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.940
Amu-senpai!

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:51.540
So, you should keeping trying hard!

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:57.670
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:02.010
Open Heart!

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:25.150
Amu-chi, look at that.

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:26.740
Rikka?

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:29.680
Amu-senpai!

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:31.430
Good morning!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.440
What are you doing so early?

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:38.510
But doesn't it put everyone in a good mood
when the school's sparkling clean?

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:39.560
Rikka...

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.920
I think I heard that line
somewhere before.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:46.390
I'm gonna keep doing my best
as a Guardian Apprentice!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:50.420
Amu-chan, Rikka-chan's taken
her radiance back.

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:51.510
Yeah.

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:53.890
They're pickin' up rubbish again!

00:20:54.590 --> 00:20:57.570
The Guardians are lame!

00:20:57.570 --> 00:20:58.690
Hey, you two...

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.060
You don't get it, do ya?

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:06.820
This is the job of the Guardians!

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.660
That's right! Got a problem with that?

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.290
No, not really.

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:16.460
I'm not gonna let you pick
up rubbish, so there!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.880
I-I think she...

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:22.930
...has the slightly...

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:24.810
...wrong impression...

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.830
Oops...

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:29.100
Pepe-chan, I have a feeling...

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:34.350
...that it'll be a long time until Rikka-tan's
Guardian Character hatches.

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:35.780
How 'bout that?

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:45.760
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:49.360
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:54.170
Which egg will be the lucky one!

00:21:57.780 --> 00:21:59.970
Guardian Egg Friendship Fortune!

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:02.270
First, for those of you
that chose Su's egg...

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:04.960
Four Shugoluck Stars! Super Lucky!

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:09.790
Everything'll go according to plan

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:10.090
You'll have a fun time with your friends! Put
it in your diary and you'll be even luckier!

00:22:11.520 --> 00:22:13.400
Ran's egg gets three Shugoluck stars.

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:15.410
You'll have a chance to
make new friends!

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:15.410
People might see your charms
and raise your popularity

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:17.310
Dia's egg is two Shugoluck stars.

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:20.290
You can reunite with an old friend.

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:20.760
A chance meeting that'll be really fun

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:23.660
Finally, for those people
who chose Miki's egg...

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:26.830
You get, um, one Shugoluck star.

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:29.180
Your relationship with your
friends just might change.

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:34.020
Lucky Item: Hand Mirror

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:34.320
Be careful not to hurt the people around
you, and stay true to your own feelings.

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:39.870
Today was a lot of fun again!

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:42.430
See you for the next
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:42.430 --> 00:22:45.660
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:45.660 --> 00:22:47.430
Bye-bye!

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:20.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:30.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:33.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:37.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:43.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:48.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:55.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:55.670 --> 00:24:00.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:11.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.260
Our Songs!
